{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1000_p", "source_sha256": "161637ff6ddd667a104852753e3303266687a154dedcd527e48d4afa82d32cab", "ja": "（今回のBOT公演は『自分史上最高の瞬間！』対決。\nみんな頭を抱えているようだ。難しすぎたかな……）", "zh": "（这次BOT公演的对决主题是“自己人生中最棒的瞬间！”。大家好像都在抱头苦思。是不是太难了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "4a9178a613ba9fdaed01cf2f567c02dc147370ded6334f66edbfbbc68a331776", "ja": "う～ん……う～～～ん……！", "zh": "嗯……嗯～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1002_p", "source_sha256": "169814fddadc16f6ffa0aa45d6e80d90eed6d6ad835029b5c01e1cc1270fadf7", "ja": "（ああ、ここにも悩んでるアイドルが……）", "zh": "（啊，这里也有个正在烦恼的偶像……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "b3e428620fd140bb8fe3ecb6d571f95aaedd4a26df9e9b7ad6ef44865b23b94b", "ja": "大和撫子といえば、やはり和装……。ですが、\nどの時代を選ぶかで印象が全然違いますし……。", "zh": "说到大和抚子，果然还是和服……可是，\n选择哪个时代，给人的印象会完全不同呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "0c8bd530ed24cca316b17b493d1dc789661dfb29b2055a1c1c5721fca6a4d196", "ja": "十二単は古式ゆかしく豪華、でも大和撫子の神髄は華美\nにあらず……大和撫子闘争の勝利のためには……。", "zh": "十二单古雅而华贵，但大和抚子的精髓并不在于华美\n……为了赢得大和抚子之战……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5089cae3d1a5b41342ce35b92bf4d8977c298aae55691ff8ca748332bf22af26", "ja": "お疲れ様、エミリー。……おや？\nたくさん着物の本が積まれてるけど、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，艾米莉。……咦？\n堆了这么多和服方面的书，是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "3ca813ecca53ccce8c1417f5e3fdad9b0ee9b0294e486f06b256968f706f9d52", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……！　これは、その……\n母が貸してくれたんです。参考になれば、と。", "zh": "制作人……！这是，那个……\n是母亲借给我的，说是或许能派上用场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1007_p", "source_sha256": "25a30c6d3b1f93fc20e425232022b8586c875cb64afac74631d571b9727f4a4a", "ja": "お母さんが？", "zh": "你妈妈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "0af0921250d63996c948434cad58f14854c36bedb5ef985ef8de1cbec53c38c5", "ja": "はい。私がずっと悩んでいたものですから、事情を\n聞かれて。それで今回の話をしたら、この本を……。", "zh": "是的。因为我一直都很苦恼，所以妈妈问起了缘由。我把这次的事情告诉她之后，她就把这本书……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "2b3604d4beed147946e91c638279f8d40d56b254b1afbfce3220b8970f738b6f", "ja": "そのあと、母から父に伝わって……。\n部屋には様々な時代劇の青紫円盤が置いてあります。", "zh": "之后，妈妈又告诉了爸爸……  \n房间里摆放着各种时代剧的蓝紫圆盘。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5949c22e79b315fec063da0eab5531a6399e39f4d88fa5bbcddd1a26e0a3a374", "ja": "そ、そうか。資料があるのはいいことだけど、\nもしかして、選択肢が広がりすぎて……？", "zh": "这、这样啊。有资料是好事，不过，会不会选择太多了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "ef28137a9f5458deba7281764442ac9b3b941c9da5d5be64816ac20829833330", "ja": "そうなんです……。でも、両親のせいにはできません！\n私が自分で考えて、しっかり決めなくては。", "zh": "就是这样……可是，不能把责任推给父母！\n我必须自己思考，慎重地做出决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "5a1ad56503d18615f480da1fc0ca3f9963066e6f0f1b51f5810804d663bb4ef9", "ja": "私史上最高の瞬間……最高を名乗る以上、\n本当に最高の瞬間を見極めなくては！", "zh": "我人生中最棒的时刻……既然要称之为最棒，就必须看清真正最棒的时刻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1013_p", "source_sha256": "36cbcdc4560c4af55708a72ff932d140209286dd8493c56babf77ffba2623de7", "ja": "エミリー……。そうだな。\n真剣勝負だからこそ、本気でぶつかり合わないとな。", "zh": "艾米莉……是啊。\n正因为是认真较量，才必须全力以赴地交锋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "52a8353887713ed55d7329263f37182f10e0f014f088d3c4ccf3cf0c8913d6f2", "ja": "はい。開催公演の時に、そのことに気づけてよかった\nです。でなければ、今頃は立ち往生していました。", "zh": "是的。还好在演出举办时意识到这一点\n了。否则，到现在恐怕还会束手无策。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "aa2c804ecf7a81a45d80aa927e53fe35da29d3d7f6e4b607b3a36db1d8841175", "ja": "苦しみの末に仕上がった本気の一枚は、きっと……\n胸を張ってお見せできるものになっているはずです！", "zh": "历经苦难、倾注真心完成的这一幅作品，一定……已经成为能够让人挺起胸膛展示的作品了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0623_1016_p", "source_sha256": "17af2a58ca23eacb65b4441c0a1fb0884e4854abffc860063e6c0b8bc21ee88c", "ja": "（本気を引き出すためには、高いハードルも必要だ。\n難しいテーマかと思ってたが、大丈夫そうだな）", "zh": "（想要引出真正的实力，就需要设置足够高的难度。\n我本来还以为会是个很难的主题，不过看来没问题了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
